reports/
*.报告.md
*报告*.md

# ===== 不入库：第三方仓库克隆 =====
repos/

# ===== 构建产物 =====
build/
target/
dist/
*.o
*.so
*.a
*.dll
*.dylib
!rust/**/Makefile

# ===== 本机/环境 =====
.env
*.log
.zcode/
.workbuddy/

# ===== 审查会话临时诊断残留（报告 L12：防误提交）=====
/.raw*.txt
/.rev*.txt
/.qjs_hash.txt
/.review*.txt
/_dl/

# ===== 工具链下载物 =====
tools/downloads/

# ===== Python venv（仅配置文件标记仓库有 venv 即可）=====
tools/.venv/
!tools/.venv/pyvenv.cfg
